			"notes": "# Version 3.0  of *Glowing Entites* is out 🥳 \n### *Changelog:*\n```js\n- Fixed mod logic, From now the default entity light level will be set to 15.\n- Rewrite command logic, now you can only input numbers between -1 to 15, input-1 or 0 to turn off the mod.\n- Added support for the new Minecraft version 1.20.5 ✨\n```\n\nAs usual, please report any issues [here](https://github.com/I-No-oNe/Glowing-entities/issues), please be aware that @uhb217 has left this project 😭 \n\n## Tysm for using the mod!"
		},
